<title>POLAND: Tonsil sees 1997 net up to PLN 1.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Tonsil sees 1997 net up to PLN 1.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish speaker-systems maker Tonsil SA expects to lift its 1997 net profit to 1.49 million zlotys, from last year's 0.24 million, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Tonsil said it expected its sales to grow to 83.72 million zlotys from 66.76 million in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
